{"packId":"daily-2026-11-01","packVersion":2,"scoringVersion":1,"date":"2026-11-01","number":46,"puzzles":[{"id":"2026-11-01-pattern","skill":"pattern","kind":"grid","prompt":"Which shape completes the grid?","cells":[{"shape":"square","tone":"teal"},{"shape":"circle","tone":"blue"},{"shape":"triangle","tone":"navy"},{"shape":"circle","tone":"blue"},{"shape":"triangle","tone":"navy"},{"shape":"square","tone":"teal"},{"shape":"triangle","tone":"navy"},{"shape":"square","tone":"teal"},null],"options":[{"shape":"diamond","tone":"gold"},{"shape":"circle","tone":"blue"},{"shape":"square","tone":"teal"},{"shape":"triangle","tone":"navy"}],"answer":1,"explanation":["Every row and every column uses each shape exactly once.","Its row already has the navy triangle and the teal square.","Its column already has the navy triangle and the teal square.","That leaves the blue circle."]},{"id":"2026-11-01-sudoku","skill":"sudoku","prompt":"Fill the grid with 1 to 6","size":6,"boxR":2,"boxC":3,"givens":[6,0,0,4,0,2,0,0,0,1,0,6,0,3,0,0,0,5,1,0,5,0,4,3,0,2,4,0,6,0,0,1,0,3,0,0],"solution":[6,5,1,4,3,2,2,4,3,1,5,6,4,3,2,6,1,5,1,6,5,2,4,3,3,2,4,5,6,1,5,1,6,3,2,4],"explanation":["Every row, every column and every 2×3 box uses each number from 1 to 6 exactly once.","The finished grid:","Row 1: 6 5 1 4 3 2","Row 2: 2 4 3 1 5 6","Row 3: 4 3 2 6 1 5","Row 4: 1 6 5 2 4 3","Row 5: 3 2 4 5 6 1","Row 6: 5 1 6 3 2 4"]},{"id":"2026-11-01-logic","skill":"logic","prompt":"Crack the 3-digit code","clues":[{"guess":[5,9,8],"rightPlace":0,"wrongPlace":0},{"guess":[0,3,7],"rightPlace":0,"wrongPlace":1},{"guess":[9,0,3],"rightPlace":0,"wrongPlace":0},{"guess":[9,6,2],"rightPlace":2,"wrongPlace":0}],"answer":[7,6,2],"explanation":["598: none of 5, 9, 8 appear in the code.","037: 7 is in the code but placed differently.","903: none of 9, 0, 3 appear in the code.","962: 6, 2 are in the right spot."],"hint":"The last digit is even."}]}